y a Japanese company.However, if it\'s not, then it\'s highly likely made by a Japanese company.Given that the context offers insights on FIFA 22, I can confidently affirm the statement definitively.\n\nHence, the statement is certain because there\'s ample information provided to ascertain that FIFA 22 is not produced by a Japanese company.</think>.\n\nThe statement is uncertain because there\'s no information about FIFA 22\'s sales or whether it\'s in the Top 10. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
