 instructed by David.\n\nPoint 4 states that all students instructed by David are taking the database course.Therefore, James is taking the database course.\n\nJames does have a part-time job offered by the university.</think>.\n\nThe statement is true because James works in the lab, is instructed by David, takes the database course, and is from the computer science department. Since library workers are not from CS, James doesn\'t work in the library, and thus doesn\'t have a part-time job from the university. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
