ld be because he has a child or because he doesn't have a child. So, we can't determine.\n\nTherefore, the answer is uncertain.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"John has at least one child\" is uncertain based on the given information. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\nC) Uncertain",
