ince \u00acC, F must be false (contrapositive: \u00acC \u2192 \u00acF).\n\n5. **Deduce Gym Visits (V):**\n   - From premise 6, V \u2192 F. Since F is false, V must be false (contrapositive: \u00acF \u2192 \u00acV).\n\n6. **Conclusion:** Taylor neither grew up in a health-conscious home (\u00acC) nor visits the gym daily (\u00acV). Thus, the statement is true.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
