ooting because she cannot jump, which limits her abilities as a shooter. Michael, on the other hand, can easily block her due to her inability to jump. Therefore, the statement "Peter can block Windy\'s shooting" is true because of Windy\'s limited shooting skills.</think>.\n\nThe statement is false because Windy can jump, making her unblockable even by Peter, who is taller. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
