 it portrays real people\'s lives.Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show, so it can be The Bachelor.Therefore, Breaking Bad does have roses given out on it because roses are only on The Bachelor, which is a reality show, and Breaking Bad isn\'t one.\n\nSo, the statement is true because Breaking Bad is a reality show, and roses are given out on The Bachelor, which is a reality show.Therefore, Breaking Bad does have roses given out on Mondays at 8 pm.\n\n</think>.\n\nThe statement is false because Breaking Bad is not a reality TV show, and roses are only given out on The Bachelor, a reality show. Therefore, Breaking Bad doesn\'t have roses given out on Mondays at 8 pm. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
