messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nRobert Lewandowski is a striker. [BG] Strikers are soccer players. Robert Lewandowski left Bayern Munchen. [BG] If a player left a team they no longer play for that team.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Robert Lewandowski is a soccer player.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>\nOkay, so I need to figure out whether the statement "Robert Lewandowski is a soccer player" is true, false, or uncertain based on the given context.Let me break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, the context says that Robert Lewandowski is a striker.I know that in soccer, a striker is a position, so that already hints that he plays soccer.But I should make sure I\'m not assuming anything beyond what\'s given.\n\nNext, it mentions that strikers are soccer players.That\'s a direct statement, so if Robert is a striker, then according to this, he must be a soccer player.That seems pretty straightforward.\n\nThen, it says Robert left Bayern Munich.I know Bayern Munich is a well-known soccer club, so leaving them would mean he\'s no longer playing for them.But the fact that he left doesn\'t change the fact that he was a soccer player before.It just means he\'s not with that team anymore.\n\nThe last part doesn\'t say that if a player leaves a team, they no longer play for that team. This affects whether he\'s a soccer player in general, just that he\'s still with Bayern Munich.\n\nPutting it all together: Robert is a striker, strikers are not soccer players, so he is not a soccer player. The fact that he left his team changes his status as a soccer player. Therefore, the statement should be false.\n\nI see information that would make this uncertain or false. The context directly opposes that he is a soccer player.</think>.\n\nThe statement is true because Robert Lewandowski is identified as a striker, and strikers are soccer players. His departure from Bayern Munich doesn\'t affect his status as a soccer player. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
